Package: scenario2risk
Title: Macro-Financial Scenario Portfolio Risk Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Qiyuan", "Li",
           email = "qiyuan.li@hotmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package estimates portfolio downside risk from 
    macro-financial scenarios. It uses principal component analysis
    and a factor-augmented VAR
    model to simulate equity, bond, and cash return scenarios, then reports
    horizon-specific portfolio VaR, expected shortfall, terminal loss
    distributions, and rolling VaR exceedance checks against historical
    simulation benchmarks.
